  "period_note": "Balance sheet is the 30-Sep-2024 period-end snapshot (reported), Solo basis. Income statement items are CUMULATIVE from 1 January 2024 (9-month). Cross-checked against this filing's own 31-Dec-2023 comparative column, which matches this dataset's existing 2023_Q4.json exactly for total_assets (317,770.681881m), total_equity (19,242.96641m), total_deposits (240,246.874582m), gross_loans (224,334.721458m) and off_balance_sheet_exposures (60,875.049205m). Paid-up capital rose to 10,658.21887m by this date (from 10,297.79601m at 30-Jun-2024) - a bonus share issuance between Jun and Sep 2024, matching the FY2024 year-end figure exactly (no further change in Q4). statutory_reserve for the current period was dropped by OCR between 'Paid-up Capital' and 'Surplus in profit & loss account'; CALCULATED as prior year-end (7,443.591894m) + this quarter's own reported statutory-reserve appropriation (478.108457m) = 7,921.700351m - the appropriation is exactly 20.00% of 9-month profit-before-tax (2,390.542286m x 20% = 478.108457m), consistent with Q1/Q2's rate. Balance-sheet identity holds exactly (303,685.695675 + 20,362.482472 = 324,048.178147). Income statement reconciles: operating_profit = total_operating_income - total_operating_expenses (11,028.497083-4,977.398886=6,051.098197, matches 6,051.098198 reported); profit_before_tax = operating_profit - total_provision (6,051.098198-3,660.555911=2,390.542287, matches 2,390.542286); profit_after_tax = profit_before_tax - tax_expense (2,390.542286-654.246544=1,736.295742 exact). IMPORTANT CONTEXT FOR INSIGHTS: this 9-month cumulative profit-before-tax of 2,390.542286m is far ABOVE the bank's own audited FY2024 annual profit-before-tax of only 608.870334m (2024_Q4.json) - implying a full Q4-2024-alone pre-tax LOSS of approximately 1,781.67m (608.870334 - 2,390.542286), a collapse invisible in this unaudited 9-month filing. See insights.json.",
